                         !Calc
                         =====

!Calc is a simple four-function (add, subtract, multiply
and divide) desk calculator. It was part of Arthur and
RISC OS 2, and in RISC OS 3.0 and 3.1 it lived in the ROM
(open the Apps icon). RISC OS 3.5 replaced it with
!SciCalc.

Click on the !Calc icon on the icon bar to open the
Calculator window, then click on the keys. Results appear
in the number window above the keys.

You can also type on the numeric keypad (with Num Lock
on) after clicking on the number window: Enter is the
equals key and Delete is C (clear).

Calculations are worked out as you go, like a pocket
calculator: 2 + 3 x 4 = gives 20. Numbers have up to
eight digits. Some operations, such as division by zero,
make the calculator show Error: clear this by clicking
on C.

Closing the window leaves !Calc on the icon bar. To quit,
choose Quit from the icon bar menu.

(This copy of !Calc is a recreation, for the RISC OS 3.71
desktop in the browser, of the RISC OS 2 version 0.40.)
